{{!-- Crewing (R20 .dcc-crewing, read-only): the vehicles this actor crews and the role held on
      each, from the vehicles' crew lists (DCCCreatureSheet#crewing). Crew are linked, unlinked and
      given roles on the vehicle sheet; a chip opens that vehicle. Hidden when on no crew. --}}
{{#if crewing.length}}
<div class="dcc-crewing">
  <span class="dcc-flabel">{{localize "DCC.Crew.Crewing"}}</span>
  {{#each crewing}}
  <button type="button" class="dcc-vchip dcc-crewing-chip" data-action="openCrewing" data-view-only data-uuid="{{uuid}}"
          data-tooltip="{{localize 'DCC.Crew.OpenVehicleTooltip'}}">{{name}} <span class="val">{{localize roleKey}}</span></button>
  {{/each}}
</div>
{{/if}}
